"document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:3:1660101002":{"key":"choice_prompt:3:1660101002","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1660101002","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"<style=highlight>春焰庆</style>临近，神秘屋收到了很多老朋友寄来的祝福信，还有不少礼物呢。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1660101003:1":{"key":"say:4:1660101003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你又忘记了吗？春焰庆是一年的伊始，是一个非常快乐的节日。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1660101004:1":{"key":"say:5:1660101004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"刚好，趁着这个节日，你终于可以好好休息一下了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1660101006:1":{"key":"say:6:1660101006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"按照伊索米亚的习俗，筹备春焰庆，战胜巨兽，等待黎明的阶...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1660101007:1":{"key":"say:7:1660101007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"而战胜巨兽后，人们就会开始彻夜庆贺，直到迎接一个又一个...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1660101008:1":{"key":"say:8:1660101008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"开阳阶段，许多城镇会彻夜点亮彩灯，燃放烟火，举行集市。...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1660101009:1":{"key":"say:9:1660101009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"对了，有不少人都提到想来阿瓦隆拜访你。不过……月桂酒馆...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1660101010:1":{"key":"say:10:1660101010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我有点想额外开辟一片区域，建造一个小型集市来招待大家。...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:11:1660101010":{"key":"choice_prompt:11:1660101010","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1660101010","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我有点想额外开辟一片区域，建造一个小型集市来招待大家。梅林大人，你觉得如何？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1660101011:1":{"key":"say:12:1660101011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"太好了，那我立刻就着手准备。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1660101012:1":{"key":"say:13:1660101012:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101012","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但这样的话，可能也需要准备更多食物……该怎么办呢……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1660101013:1":{"key":"say:14:1660101013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1660101013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"回想着家园的景象，欣欣向荣的农田是你最为满意的，但即使...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:166010